                    {
                        "sense_id": "bde0206c-aa49-3887-b265-91354d50e0b6",
                        "entry_id": "483ef171-89b3-3e9d-9b1f-0f8c35366ce8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One or two rings of tooth-like appendages surrounding the opening of the capsule of many mosses."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dd15d242-d2cd-4af6-922a-889e7daae235",
                                "sense_id": "bde0206c-aa49-3887-b265-91354d50e0b6",
                                "text": "Its removal does not, however, leave the mouth of the capsule wide open, for around the margin are two circles of pointed teeth forming the peristome."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e54f659a-7b1d-37be-ab79-ae63253c45c8",
                        "entry_id": "483ef171-89b3-3e9d-9b1f-0f8c35366ce8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The parts of or surrounding the mouths of numerous invertebrates."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4217a532-eee9-4715-b1fc-f47abfd4e32f",
                                "sense_id": "e54f659a-7b1d-37be-ab79-ae63253c45c8",
                                "text": "We can distinguish therefore in the body of a polyp the column, circular or oval in section, forming the trunk, resting on a base or foot and surmounted by the crown of tentacles, which enclose an area termed the peristome, in the centre of which again is the mouth. […] The mouth may be level with the surface of the peristome, or may be projecting and trumpet-shaped."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b0cc24b9-956f-3121-972d-aee1aa1f6e35",
                        "entry_id": "483ef171-89b3-3e9d-9b1f-0f8c35366ce8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The lip, or edge of the aperture, of a spiral shell."
                        ],
